Datasets (not redistributed)
----------------------------
LongMemEval / LongMemEval-S (cleaned)
  Wu et al., "LongMemEval: Benchmarking Chat Assistants on Long-Term Interactive Memory".
  https://github.com/xiaowu0162/LongMemEval, data at https://huggingface.co/datasets/xiaowu0162/longmemeval-cleaned
  MIT License. Downloaded at a pinned revision by scripts/download_data.py. This repository contains only
  question ids, per-row verdicts and short excerpts of model-extracted memories needed to document results
  (paper/data/snapshot.json.gz); no dialogue is included.

MemConflict
  Tao et al., MemConflict (arXiv:2605.20926), https://github.com/TaoZhen1110/MemConflict
  The source repository declares no license, so its data is not redistributed here. Obtain Data/Step4_4.jsonl
  from that repository. This repository contains only question ids, type labels and audit verdicts for the
  90-question evaluation split, plus the split-construction script (scripts/make_memconflict_split.py).

Dependencies (installed, not bundled)
-------------------------------------
Mem0 OSS (mem0ai==1.0.11), https://github.com/mem0ai/mem0, Apache License 2.0.
Other Python dependencies are pinned in uv.lock and keep their own licenses.

Models
------
Experiments call third-party models (local gemma4 and qwen3-embedding through Ollama; cloud readers, extractor and
judges through an OpenAI-compatible endpoint). No model weights are included; each model's terms apply to its use.
